WEBVTT

00:31.567 --> 00:35.117
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.137 --> 00:38.517
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.787 --> 00:44.757
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.917 --> 00:49.547
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.567 --> 00:53.077
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.097 --> 00:56.587
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.607 --> 01:00.117
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.137 --> 01:06.197
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.457 --> 01:23.737
Si Jin

01:23.757 --> 01:27.737
Episode 13

01:27.737 --> 01:30.257
(Zhou)

01:32.417 --> 01:33.837
I'll take it back

01:33.857 --> 01:35.237
and tend to it carefully.

01:35.257 --> 01:37.197
When you want it,

01:37.217 --> 01:38.577
I'll send it over.

01:40.257 --> 01:41.617
Goodbye then.

01:56.577 --> 01:58.177
Mr. Yu.

02:04.417 --> 02:06.997
Gentlemen don't eavesdrop.

02:07.017 --> 02:09.297
This is already the second time.

02:10.697 --> 02:11.577
I...

02:11.577 --> 02:13.977
I'm no gentleman.

02:19.817 --> 02:21.177
Sorry.

02:21.577 --> 02:23.377
At first, I thought

02:23.377 --> 02:25.457
you had feelings for Mr. Zhen.

02:26.977 --> 02:29.137
Whoever I have feelings for,

02:29.377 --> 02:30.957
it's none of your business.

02:30.977 --> 02:32.557
Of course, it does.

02:32.577 --> 02:34.537
Must you speak to me so coldly?

02:34.537 --> 02:35.897
Aren't we...

02:37.377 --> 02:38.737
What?

02:41.017 --> 02:42.377
Neighbors?

02:44.297 --> 02:46.177
Mr. Yu, you truly jest.

02:46.377 --> 02:48.397
You returned my begonia gift

02:48.417 --> 02:50.017
for the housewarming.

02:50.257 --> 02:52.117
Someone as mighty as you

02:52.137 --> 02:54.177
is out of my league.

02:55.857 --> 02:57.237
Returned your gift?

02:57.257 --> 02:58.617
I didn't.

02:59.977 --> 03:01.577
It must be Long Dan.

03:01.697 --> 03:02.657
That good-for-nothing

03:02.657 --> 03:04.297
who fails at everything.

03:08.657 --> 03:10.237
Something's wrong with the soil.

03:10.257 --> 03:13.697
Please take a look at that.

03:13.717 --> 03:14.857
What's wrong with the soil?

03:14.857 --> 03:16.637
- It...
- Yu!

03:16.657 --> 03:18.397
I always miss it.

03:18.417 --> 03:19.817
Is something wrong with the bow?

03:19.817 --> 03:21.737
Come and take a look.

03:22.177 --> 03:23.357
Long Dan,

03:23.377 --> 03:24.697
go take a look.

03:24.697 --> 03:26.057
Yes.

03:33.417 --> 03:36.537
The soil is a bit loose.

03:37.177 --> 03:38.857
- Really?
- Yes.

03:39.057 --> 03:40.817
You'll know it once you see it.

03:41.817 --> 03:42.977
Why didn't you say so earlier?

03:42.977 --> 03:45.137
I had to wait for the chance.

03:46.417 --> 03:48.117
Actually, today,

03:48.137 --> 03:49.577
I'm not resting.

03:50.377 --> 03:52.977
I came to teach Jiang Zhan
how to ride and shoot,

03:53.137 --> 03:54.837
and I also wanted to ask you

03:54.857 --> 03:57.137
if something was wrong.

04:02.017 --> 04:04.977
You dreamed that Jiang Zhan would die?

04:05.817 --> 04:07.657
But dreams aren't real.

04:07.937 --> 04:09.577
What if it comes true?

04:09.737 --> 04:11.957
The dream was very vivid.

04:11.977 --> 04:13.597
I saw my brother fall into the water

04:13.617 --> 04:15.197
and the fire in the tavern spreading,

04:15.217 --> 04:17.117
and there was
my brother's memorial tablet

04:17.137 --> 04:18.977
in my family's ancestral hall.

04:19.817 --> 04:21.837
What if my brother really dies?

04:21.857 --> 04:23.637
I have to prepare for the worst.

04:24.497 --> 04:25.957
I hit it!

04:25.977 --> 04:27.117
Yu, Si.

04:27.137 --> 04:29.117
Look, I hit it.

04:29.137 --> 04:30.377
Come and take a look.

04:30.377 --> 04:32.217
Based on Jiang Zhan's personality,

04:32.297 --> 04:33.557
if you keep him

04:33.577 --> 04:34.937
at home every day,

04:34.937 --> 04:36.477
it will only backfire.

04:36.497 --> 04:38.977
He will find ways to run out.

04:39.177 --> 04:40.597
How about this?

04:40.617 --> 04:42.477
When he goes out,

04:42.497 --> 04:44.837
we can take turns and follow him.

04:44.857 --> 04:46.217
What do you think?

04:46.617 --> 04:47.897
Don't you think what I'm saying

04:47.897 --> 04:48.917
is absurd?

04:48.937 --> 04:50.657
I know you care about him.

04:54.297 --> 04:56.777
Did Miss Si really say that?

04:57.497 --> 04:58.857
Yes.

04:59.137 --> 05:02.217
I've taken the liberty and told Miss Si

05:02.577 --> 05:04.157
to temporarily put off

05:04.177 --> 05:05.657
the marriage proposal.

05:06.057 --> 05:07.297
Come on.

05:07.297 --> 05:08.597
Your bride-to-be has slipped away

05:08.597 --> 05:09.797
just like that.

05:09.817 --> 05:12.597
Mother, we should respect

05:12.617 --> 05:14.897
Miss Si's wishes.

05:17.297 --> 05:20.337
Forget it. I was too impatient.

05:20.497 --> 05:23.117
On Lady Jiang's birthday,

05:23.137 --> 05:24.297
she was framed.

05:24.297 --> 05:27.037
I thought that her family

05:27.057 --> 05:28.717
was a place full of trouble,

05:28.737 --> 05:30.797
so I was eager to propose to her.

05:30.817 --> 05:31.857
I just wanted her

05:31.857 --> 05:33.377
to marry you sooner

05:33.377 --> 05:35.117
to prevent her from suffering.

05:35.497 --> 05:37.097
But now,

05:38.577 --> 05:40.857
it seems I shouldn't force her.

05:44.937 --> 05:46.897
Mother, you did everything for me.

05:47.137 --> 05:48.677
What do you plan to do?

05:48.697 --> 05:51.337
Should we just let the marriage go?

05:56.177 --> 05:58.197
Knowing one's limits
is the way to advance.

05:58.217 --> 06:00.437
Looking afar is the way to be motivated.

06:01.057 --> 06:03.297
I won't give up

06:05.057 --> 06:07.657
until Miss Si is engaged.

06:08.137 --> 06:09.497
Good.

06:53.537 --> 06:57.137
(The past is
like autumn leaves falling.)

06:57.137 --> 07:01.097
(There's still enough time
to resolve every difficulty.)

07:11.167 --> 07:14.737
♪ Looking back,
I recall our first encounter ♪

07:14.757 --> 07:18.277
♪ Feelings remain
but things are complicated ♪

07:18.297 --> 07:21.547
♪ Thoughts replay ♪

07:21.887 --> 07:24.957
♪ I can't make up my mind ♪

07:27.137 --> 07:27.837
Chief,

07:27.857 --> 07:29.757
how many characters will you write?

07:31.057 --> 07:32.457
Is this big enough?

07:32.577 --> 07:34.657
Continue with your work.

07:36.067 --> 07:39.837
♪ Shattering the dreams ♪

07:40.257 --> 07:41.977
The past is

07:42.497 --> 07:44.857
like autumn leaves falling.

07:45.177 --> 07:49.537
There's still enough time
to resolve every difficulty.

07:50.817 --> 07:54.127
♪ How can I move on ♪

07:54.127 --> 07:57.997
♪ I can't forget about you ♪

07:58.017 --> 08:01.407
♪ However long the road is ♪

08:01.427 --> 08:05.687
♪ If love is strong,
one will have no fear ♪

08:06.937 --> 08:08.637
(Is there really enough time)

08:09.057 --> 08:10.897
(to resolve every difficulty?)

08:15.907 --> 08:19.417
♪ Can I still make it
through the long night ♪

08:19.437 --> 08:23.057
♪ I fear that we'll part again ♪

08:23.077 --> 08:26.427
♪ A piercing ache lingers within ♪

08:26.427 --> 08:30.037
♪ Shattering the dreams ♪

08:30.057 --> 08:33.927
♪ How many petals fell, I count ♪

08:33.947 --> 08:37.487
♪ It equals the times I think about you ♪

08:37.507 --> 08:41.177
♪ The past fades as old dreams return ♪

08:41.177 --> 08:44.487
♪ How can I move on ♪

08:44.487 --> 08:48.357
♪ I can't forget about you ♪

08:48.377 --> 08:51.957
♪ However long the road is ♪

08:51.977 --> 08:55.567
♪ No matter the cost,
I'll try to restore ♪

08:55.567 --> 09:02.677
♪ The sealed memories ♪

09:13.337 --> 09:14.297
Have another look.

09:14.297 --> 09:15.697
(Fragrance Shop)
It's 50% off now.

09:15.697 --> 09:16.937
Ma'am, take a look.

09:16.937 --> 09:17.817
It's 50% off now.

09:17.817 --> 09:18.667
- Ma'am.
- Come in.

09:18.667 --> 09:19.857
It's 50% off. Please come in.

09:19.857 --> 09:21.097
Please come in. It's 50% off.

09:21.097 --> 09:22.637
- Take a look.
- How about your wife?

09:22.637 --> 09:23.577
- No.
- It's 50% off.

09:23.577 --> 09:25.197
Please come inside and take a look.

09:25.207 --> 09:26.177
- No.
- It smells nice.

09:26.177 --> 09:27.277
It's 50% off. Have a look.

09:27.297 --> 09:28.697
- It's 50% off. Take a look.
- No.

09:28.697 --> 09:29.897
Miss, come on.

09:29.897 --> 09:31.557
(Fragrance Shop)

09:31.557 --> 09:32.837
The shop was finally renovated,

09:32.857 --> 09:34.557
but the business
has dropped dramatically.

09:34.557 --> 09:36.917
No one has visited
for several days in a row.

09:36.937 --> 09:38.057
Even the regular customers

09:38.057 --> 09:39.617
have returned their goods.

09:39.657 --> 09:41.277
I secretly asked them the reason,

09:41.297 --> 09:43.437
and they said that a noble told them

09:43.457 --> 09:45.097
whoever dared to buy anything here

09:45.097 --> 09:46.657
was going against them.

09:46.697 --> 09:48.057
As for who this person is,

09:48.057 --> 09:49.057
they dare not tell me.

09:49.057 --> 09:50.277
Since it's a noble,

09:50.297 --> 09:52.537
they won't be
from another fragrance shop.

09:53.297 --> 09:55.197
Perhaps you offended someone.

09:55.217 --> 09:56.457
Several of our regular customers

09:56.457 --> 09:58.977
are families of noble officials.

09:58.997 --> 10:00.417
This person has managed to stop them

10:00.417 --> 10:01.797
from shopping here.

10:01.817 --> 10:03.657
Who could it be?

10:04.337 --> 10:05.337
I'll go ask Miss Si.

10:05.337 --> 10:06.277
Wait for me.

10:06.297 --> 10:08.617
Miss, take a look at our perfume.

10:09.897 --> 10:10.817
Miss, Young Master,

10:10.817 --> 10:11.697
what should we do?

10:11.697 --> 10:13.697
Still, no one wants to come in.

10:14.217 --> 10:15.757
Everyone, please stay calm.

10:15.777 --> 10:17.937
Commandant Yu is investigating this.

10:18.017 --> 10:18.937
As the saying goes,

10:18.937 --> 10:20.557
good things are worth the wait.

10:20.577 --> 10:22.557
I don't believe anyone

10:22.577 --> 10:24.397
can truly block all our customers.

10:24.417 --> 10:25.777
You're right, Si.

10:26.177 --> 10:27.417
I'll treat my friends

10:27.417 --> 10:28.937
to some drinks these days

10:28.937 --> 10:30.517
and have them introduce some customers.

10:30.537 --> 10:31.757
It won't work.

10:31.777 --> 10:32.797
Why?

10:32.817 --> 10:34.057
Your playful friends

10:34.057 --> 10:35.277
won't be of any help.

10:35.297 --> 10:36.517
Are you trying

10:36.537 --> 10:37.917
to go out and have fun again?

10:37.937 --> 10:39.097
It's serious now.

10:39.097 --> 10:40.037
How can I be in the mood

10:40.037 --> 10:41.157
for fun and games?

10:41.177 --> 10:43.177
How could you think of me like that?

10:48.177 --> 10:49.397
Alright.

10:49.417 --> 10:50.537
Anyway, you cannot

10:50.537 --> 10:52.177
look for those friends.

10:52.657 --> 10:54.017
Got it.

11:06.457 --> 11:12.977
(Fragrance Shop)

11:16.057 --> 11:18.157
You're killing me.

11:18.177 --> 11:20.517
Enough already.

11:20.537 --> 11:22.417
Don't laugh yourself to death.

11:22.657 --> 11:24.057
This is the first time I've heard

11:24.057 --> 11:26.337
of a sister locking her brother at home

11:26.337 --> 11:27.697
and making him stay indoors.

11:27.697 --> 11:28.797
What do you know?

11:28.817 --> 11:30.917
My sister is doing it for my own good.

11:30.937 --> 11:32.877
(Zhang Sheng)
She wants me to have less fun

11:32.897 --> 11:34.557
and work harder to improve myself.

11:34.577 --> 11:35.937
Fine.

11:36.057 --> 11:37.177
Then I'll leave now,

11:37.177 --> 11:38.397
so I don't delay your progress.

11:38.417 --> 11:39.697
Don't. Don't go.

11:39.697 --> 11:41.377
Come back, come back.

11:42.337 --> 11:43.437
You don't know

11:43.457 --> 11:45.917
how boring it is to drink alone.

11:45.937 --> 11:47.457
You, a grown man,

11:47.457 --> 11:49.157
obey your sister like this.

11:49.177 --> 11:50.557
Aren't you ashamed?

11:50.577 --> 11:51.937
So what?

11:52.097 --> 11:52.937
My sister is

11:52.937 --> 11:54.077
ten times smarter than me.

11:54.097 --> 11:56.497
She is always right.

11:56.577 --> 11:59.277
The more obedient you are,

11:59.297 --> 12:00.577
the less she'll think of you.

12:00.577 --> 12:02.937
My sister wouldn't think less of me.

12:04.057 --> 12:05.417
Right?

12:07.817 --> 12:09.557
She's your sister.

12:09.577 --> 12:11.297
Can she say that openly?

12:11.337 --> 12:12.577
Your playful friends

12:12.577 --> 12:13.797
won't be of any help.

12:13.817 --> 12:15.057
Are you trying

12:15.057 --> 12:16.897
to go out and have fun again?

12:18.897 --> 12:20.157
As long as I pass the selection

12:20.177 --> 12:21.697
and join the Imperial Insignia Guard,

12:21.717 --> 12:23.557
my sister will definitely
think better of me.

12:23.557 --> 12:24.917
She will never think I'm useless.

12:24.917 --> 12:26.897
What if you don't make it?

12:29.457 --> 12:30.817
What?

12:31.177 --> 12:33.137
Are you confident?

12:42.017 --> 12:43.657
I have no confidence at all.

12:44.337 --> 12:46.397
Zhang, you know me.

12:46.417 --> 12:47.997
With my fake skills,

12:48.017 --> 12:49.757
no matter how hard I try,

12:49.777 --> 12:51.797
I'm still nervous.

12:51.817 --> 12:52.777
These women...

12:52.777 --> 12:54.477
- I don't know them.
- Xiang.

12:54.577 --> 12:55.697
They insist that a man

12:55.697 --> 12:56.937
has to hold a position

12:56.937 --> 12:58.177
to be considered successful.

12:58.197 --> 13:00.797
What's so great
about the Imperial Insignia Guard?

13:01.177 --> 13:03.297
Being out in the wind and sun all day.

13:03.577 --> 13:05.297
That's right.

13:12.537 --> 13:15.417
Haven't you thought of some way

13:15.577 --> 13:18.177
to make your sister think better of you?

13:24.017 --> 13:24.917
Zhang,

13:24.937 --> 13:26.557
do you know any

13:26.577 --> 13:28.657
rich ladies

13:29.937 --> 13:32.057
who need perfume?

13:34.777 --> 13:36.197
Yes.

13:36.217 --> 13:38.297
Really? That's great.

13:39.177 --> 13:40.537
Come on.

13:52.217 --> 13:53.577
Ji,

13:53.657 --> 13:55.377
Jiang Zhan took the bait?

13:55.577 --> 13:57.017
As expected.

13:59.817 --> 14:01.257
After this mission,

14:01.277 --> 14:02.637
the Commandery Princess has said

14:02.657 --> 14:05.237
there will be a place for you
in the Rites Office.

14:05.417 --> 14:08.137
I will not disappoint Her Grace.

14:08.897 --> 14:10.257
Goodbye.

14:22.457 --> 14:24.457
(Unlicensed Tavern)
Candied hawthorn.

14:30.057 --> 14:31.157
Zhang,

14:31.177 --> 14:32.817
is the buyer the top courtesan

14:32.817 --> 14:34.937
of some brothel?

14:34.957 --> 14:36.217
What does it matter who she is?

14:36.217 --> 14:37.797
She has money.

14:37.817 --> 14:39.697
Anyway, tonight,

14:39.697 --> 14:41.557
this lady is spending very lavishly.

14:41.577 --> 14:42.877
If you can talk her into this,

14:42.877 --> 14:44.697
you won't have to worry
about Fragrance Shop

14:44.697 --> 14:46.137
for the whole year.

14:46.817 --> 14:47.917
Promise me.

14:47.937 --> 14:48.997
You can't take the boat,

14:49.017 --> 14:50.777
nor go near the river.

14:51.577 --> 14:54.017
It's just boating. Come on.

14:54.777 --> 14:56.057
Let's forget it.

14:56.057 --> 14:57.057
If my sister knew

14:57.057 --> 14:58.297
I came to this kind of place,

14:58.297 --> 14:59.637
she'd scold me to death.

14:59.657 --> 15:01.417
Always talking about your sister.

15:01.417 --> 15:02.817
Can't you live without her?

15:02.817 --> 15:03.917
What nonsense is this?

15:03.937 --> 15:05.217
Who said I can't live

15:05.217 --> 15:06.197
without my sister?

15:06.217 --> 15:07.777
If you can, come with me.

15:07.817 --> 15:08.897
Come on, let's go.

15:08.897 --> 15:10.937
You... Slow down.

15:11.177 --> 15:12.537
Come on.

15:13.817 --> 15:15.037
Come on.

15:15.057 --> 15:16.777
Fill his glass.

15:16.817 --> 15:18.097
I'm not drinking.

15:18.097 --> 15:19.477
Come on, have a drink.

15:19.497 --> 15:24.017
(Moon House)

15:25.097 --> 15:26.277
Let me help you.

15:26.297 --> 15:27.777
Let's go, Zhang.

15:46.057 --> 15:47.537
It's the wrong way.

15:57.217 --> 15:58.577
Leave us.

16:08.537 --> 16:10.097
Your Grace, I don't know

16:10.097 --> 16:11.877
you're here with these gentlemen.

16:11.897 --> 16:12.937
My friend here

16:12.937 --> 16:13.997
took the wrong path.

16:14.017 --> 16:15.437
Sorry to disturb your enjoyment.

16:15.457 --> 16:17.397
Sorry, sorry.

16:17.417 --> 16:18.777
Hold on.

16:19.177 --> 16:22.037
It was us who asked your friend

16:22.057 --> 16:23.817
to bring you here.

16:29.937 --> 16:32.317
Your Grace, what do you mean?

16:32.337 --> 16:34.257
Don't you want to know

16:34.417 --> 16:35.417
who's blocking

16:35.417 --> 16:37.397
Fragrance Shop's livelihood?

16:37.417 --> 16:39.037
Let me tell you.

16:39.057 --> 16:40.937
It's me.

16:43.297 --> 16:44.557
Impossible.

16:44.577 --> 16:47.757
Everyone knows you're pretty and kind.

16:47.777 --> 16:49.057
How could you do such a thing?

16:49.057 --> 16:50.897
This must be my fault.

16:51.057 --> 16:52.057
I always

16:52.057 --> 16:53.617
speak without thinking.

16:53.617 --> 16:55.317
They all know this.

16:55.337 --> 16:57.297
I must've offended you

16:57.297 --> 16:58.437
somehow.

16:58.457 --> 17:00.857
I hope you can enlighten me.

17:02.057 --> 17:04.177
How sensible of you.

17:04.817 --> 17:06.177
Fine.

17:06.377 --> 17:08.517
I'm in a good mood today,

17:08.537 --> 17:10.657
so I'll let this one go.

17:10.817 --> 17:12.177
I forgive you.

17:12.897 --> 17:14.657
Thank you, Your Grace.

17:20.817 --> 17:22.737
I didn't allow you to leave.

17:24.057 --> 17:25.317
There's no seat for me.

17:25.337 --> 17:27.197
Princess Mingyue's family banquet

17:27.217 --> 17:28.137
isn't something

17:28.137 --> 17:29.717
anyone can attend.

17:29.737 --> 17:31.957
Jiang, since you're here,

17:31.977 --> 17:33.517
you must drink.

17:33.537 --> 17:35.717
Come on, serve Jiang some wine.

17:35.737 --> 17:37.097
I...

17:43.617 --> 17:44.657
Your Grace...

17:44.657 --> 17:47.097
Drink these three jars of wine,

17:47.297 --> 17:49.697
and I'll let Fragrance Shop go.

17:49.857 --> 17:51.217
How's that?

17:52.057 --> 17:53.417
This...

17:55.017 --> 17:56.377
Your Grace,

17:57.497 --> 17:58.557
are you serious?

17:58.577 --> 17:59.937
Of course.

18:07.457 --> 18:09.937
Thank you for the wine, Your Grace.

18:17.217 --> 18:18.777
I forgot to mention

18:18.797 --> 18:20.497
that this is the Fiery Wine
I brought back

18:20.497 --> 18:22.417
from the Western Regions.

18:22.617 --> 18:25.897
A few drops and you'll be
in a drunken stupor.

18:28.457 --> 18:29.637
Sorry, it slipped.

18:29.657 --> 18:30.837
What's the matter?

18:30.857 --> 18:33.037
Princess Mingyue awarded you

18:33.057 --> 18:34.597
with such a precious wine.

18:34.617 --> 18:36.177
Why not drink it?

18:37.977 --> 18:39.337
Sure.

18:40.297 --> 18:41.657
I'll drink.

18:49.817 --> 18:51.837
Zhang Sheng came to our home days ago,

18:51.857 --> 18:53.597
but I didn't think much of it.

18:53.617 --> 18:55.057
But after dinner today,

18:55.057 --> 18:56.217
my brother disappeared.

18:56.217 --> 18:57.217
Don't worry.

18:57.217 --> 18:58.377
Maybe he sneaked out to drink

18:58.377 --> 19:00.137
like last time.

19:00.657 --> 19:02.597
Why is it leaking?

19:02.617 --> 19:04.937
Come on, help him.

19:08.097 --> 19:08.877
What are you doing?

19:08.877 --> 19:10.237
You two search along this path.

19:10.237 --> 19:11.277
We'll go across the river.

19:11.277 --> 19:13.617
(Licensed Tavern)

19:15.097 --> 19:17.557
Jiang Zhan, look at you now.

19:17.577 --> 19:18.577
Run then.

19:18.577 --> 19:19.757
Cui Yi,

19:19.777 --> 19:21.697
this is the Emperor's capital.

19:21.817 --> 19:23.897
How can you do as you please?

19:32.857 --> 19:35.697
I'll fight it out with you.

19:40.857 --> 19:42.097
What will you fight with?

19:42.097 --> 19:44.377
(Yang Shengcai)
You've improved

19:44.377 --> 19:45.877
in just a few months.

19:45.897 --> 19:47.357
If you want to practice,

19:47.817 --> 19:48.777
we'll play with you.

19:48.777 --> 19:50.137
Go.

20:03.377 --> 20:04.737
Enough.

20:15.577 --> 20:16.937
Cover him.

20:18.297 --> 20:20.457
Wasn't it spilled earlier?

20:21.097 --> 20:22.457
This time,

20:23.057 --> 20:24.577
take your time.

20:25.537 --> 20:28.657
Drink slowly. No rush.

20:29.737 --> 20:31.097
Jiang Zhan!

20:31.457 --> 20:33.377
Young Master Zhan!

20:33.657 --> 20:35.057
Jiang Zhan!

20:36.817 --> 20:38.177
How's it going?

20:38.817 --> 20:40.177
Speak up.

20:42.057 --> 20:43.417
What?

20:43.817 --> 20:45.417
Kill me.

20:46.617 --> 20:47.977
Kill you?

20:49.017 --> 20:50.557
He wants us to kill him.

20:51.757 --> 20:52.617
This is the first time

20:52.617 --> 20:54.497
I've heard such a request.

21:01.457 --> 21:03.657
Take your time.

21:15.337 --> 21:16.697
Breathe.

21:18.977 --> 21:20.457
Stop playing dead.

21:21.897 --> 21:22.997
Ji...

21:23.017 --> 21:24.697
Is he...?

21:25.057 --> 21:26.417
Jiang Zhan.

21:32.497 --> 21:33.857
Jiang Zhan.

21:34.137 --> 21:35.497
Zhan.

21:37.377 --> 21:38.737
Brother...

21:38.857 --> 21:40.497
What are you doing? Who's your brother?

21:40.497 --> 21:41.757
Sorry, sorry.

21:41.777 --> 21:42.997
Sorry.

21:43.017 --> 21:44.377
Zhan?

21:49.657 --> 21:50.557
Oh, no.

21:50.577 --> 21:52.057
He's stopped breathing.

21:52.057 --> 21:53.097
He's so weak.

21:53.097 --> 21:54.197
He's dead.

21:54.217 --> 21:56.077
What should we do now, Your Grace?

21:58.137 --> 21:59.657
Strip his clothes off.

22:04.297 --> 22:05.657
Sorry.

22:33.777 --> 22:35.137
Zhan...

22:40.577 --> 22:41.937
Are you alright?

22:44.337 --> 22:45.697
Your Grace,

22:47.097 --> 22:48.697
he really is dead.

22:51.377 --> 22:52.737
Boring.

22:52.777 --> 22:54.137
What should we do?

22:56.217 --> 22:57.837
Why panic?

22:57.857 --> 22:59.097
It's just a worthless life.

22:59.097 --> 23:00.437
He's useless,

23:00.457 --> 23:02.417
but his family has a title.

23:06.057 --> 23:08.057
Just throw him into the river,

23:08.097 --> 23:09.897
and it'll be over.

23:11.297 --> 23:12.657
Come on.

23:12.977 --> 23:14.337
Throw him.

23:23.537 --> 23:24.437
Jiang Zhan.

23:24.457 --> 23:25.817
Not bad.

23:28.017 --> 23:29.947
Look, he's fallen into the water.

23:29.967 --> 23:30.857
What happened?

23:30.857 --> 23:32.417
He's probably drunk.

23:35.857 --> 23:38.697
Wake up, Zhan.

23:46.577 --> 23:48.257
(Moon House)

23:58.097 --> 24:00.377
He's fallen into the water.

24:01.537 --> 24:02.977
Mingyue,

24:03.297 --> 24:04.877
if Uncle finds out,

24:04.897 --> 24:06.817
what will we do?

24:08.817 --> 24:12.177
Take all of the servants away.

24:12.377 --> 24:13.457
Tomorrow, I don't want

24:13.457 --> 24:14.297
to see them

24:14.297 --> 24:15.897
in Ling'an anymore.

24:16.297 --> 24:18.497
No, no.

24:18.577 --> 24:20.577
Your Grace, please.

24:21.257 --> 24:22.617
Go.

24:22.737 --> 24:24.097
Hurry up.

24:24.297 --> 24:25.657
Hurry up.

24:37.017 --> 24:39.617
Everyone, you'll be

24:39.617 --> 24:41.377
generously rewarded

24:41.457 --> 24:43.817
for today.

24:43.817 --> 24:47.177
- Thanks, Your Grace.
- Thanks, Your Grace.

24:48.817 --> 24:49.837
Zhang Sheng,

24:49.857 --> 24:51.977
you're the hero of the day.

24:51.977 --> 24:53.857
You called Jiang Zhan here.

24:53.857 --> 24:55.217
What?

24:55.337 --> 24:58.457
A perfume buyer?

24:58.977 --> 25:00.797
You're bold to say that,

25:00.817 --> 25:03.417
and he's bold to believe that.

25:03.977 --> 25:04.897
No, no.

25:04.897 --> 25:06.777
- It was Ji's idea.
- Ji.

25:06.777 --> 25:07.817
It's thanks to Ji.

25:07.817 --> 25:09.077
- Ji?
- Right.

25:09.097 --> 25:10.577
Ji, Ji.

25:10.577 --> 25:12.197
- No, no.
- Good for you.

25:12.217 --> 25:14.357
We're just

25:14.377 --> 25:15.977
having fun, right?

25:15.977 --> 25:17.417
Jiang Zhan

25:17.497 --> 25:19.477
looked tough,

25:19.497 --> 25:21.257
but I just covered his face

25:21.257 --> 25:22.977
and spilled the wine,

25:23.457 --> 25:26.317
and he was dead before I could finish.

25:26.337 --> 25:28.897
Fortunately, Her Grace...

25:30.137 --> 25:31.597
Yeah.

25:31.617 --> 25:34.337
Your Grace, have you had fun today?

25:34.337 --> 25:35.737
Boring.

25:35.817 --> 25:38.457
What's the difference

25:38.657 --> 25:40.137
between humans and ants?

25:40.137 --> 25:41.557
There's no difference.

25:41.577 --> 25:43.037
They're all yours.

25:43.057 --> 25:44.457
I want

25:44.457 --> 25:46.377
Jiang Si dead.

25:47.457 --> 25:48.957
(Cui Mingyue, )

25:48.977 --> 25:50.717
(I'll make you pay)

25:50.737 --> 25:52.897
(with your blood for this now.)

25:56.217 --> 26:01.177
(Moon House)

26:29.057 --> 26:30.617
Jiang Zhan!

26:35.257 --> 26:37.337
(Moon House)

26:37.337 --> 26:40.017
(Clear Moon on the River)

26:42.297 --> 26:43.657
It's on fire.

26:43.817 --> 26:45.117
Run!

26:45.137 --> 26:47.257
Run!

27:43.457 --> 27:44.817
Miss Jiang.

27:47.497 --> 27:48.977
Those beasts...

27:49.337 --> 27:51.617
Yang Shengcai, Zhang Sheng...

27:52.057 --> 27:53.937
They tortured my brother

27:54.457 --> 27:56.497
to death

27:56.617 --> 27:57.777
and threw him

27:57.777 --> 28:00.097
into this river.

28:02.097 --> 28:05.777
(Moon House)

28:08.137 --> 28:13.097
(Moon House)

28:14.057 --> 28:15.417
Remember.

28:15.537 --> 28:16.817
You were with me all night.

28:16.817 --> 28:18.377
You didn't go anywhere.

29:03.457 --> 29:04.897
Chief, there's a cliff downstream.

29:04.897 --> 29:05.997
It's extremely dangerous.

29:06.017 --> 29:07.377
If Jiang Zhan really drifted down,

29:07.377 --> 29:09.217
he might've been dead by now.

29:11.337 --> 29:13.377
- Keep searching.
- Yes.

29:14.737 --> 29:17.977
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

29:18.057 --> 29:18.957
Your Highness.

29:18.977 --> 29:21.437
Princess Mingyue must be medicated

29:21.457 --> 29:23.417
every day to avoid scars.

29:25.777 --> 29:27.197
Be gentle, Mother.

29:27.217 --> 29:28.837
Now you know the pain.

29:28.857 --> 29:30.217
Cui Mingyue.

29:30.897 --> 29:32.117
Cui Mingyue.

29:32.137 --> 29:33.497
Look at the mess you've caused.

29:33.497 --> 29:34.857
Come out.

29:36.137 --> 29:37.497
Don't move.

29:37.577 --> 29:38.937
Lie down.

29:45.137 --> 29:47.037
You still know she's your daughter?

29:47.057 --> 29:48.797
Can't you see how badly she's hurt?

29:48.817 --> 29:50.837
What's wrong with her getting hurt?

29:50.857 --> 29:52.517
At least she's still alive.

29:52.537 --> 29:54.137
What about Cui Yi? He's gone.

29:54.137 --> 29:56.597
He was so young, barely in his twenties.

29:56.617 --> 29:58.337
He's my brother's child.

29:58.337 --> 29:59.997
How can I face my brother?

30:00.017 --> 30:02.017
What? Why blame Mingyue

30:02.017 --> 30:03.897
for his death?

30:04.097 --> 30:05.717
Did Mingyue set the fire?

30:05.737 --> 30:07.277
Did Mingyue kill him?

30:07.297 --> 30:08.657
You...

30:11.457 --> 30:14.037
Everyone in this mansion knows

30:14.057 --> 30:15.817
she was always

30:15.817 --> 30:17.497
bossing her cousin around,

30:17.497 --> 30:19.617
never showing him any respect.

30:20.017 --> 30:21.237
Also,

30:21.257 --> 30:23.277
she's an unmarried lady,

30:23.297 --> 30:24.377
but she always meets

30:24.377 --> 30:25.777
with a bunch of men late at night.

30:25.777 --> 30:28.797
Now, the tavern caught fire.

30:28.817 --> 30:30.237
Two are dead, one is wounded,

30:30.257 --> 30:32.037
and one is missing.

30:32.057 --> 30:33.297
She caused

30:33.297 --> 30:34.597
this huge disaster.

30:34.617 --> 30:37.557
As her mother, how can you defend her?

30:37.577 --> 30:38.797
Listen.

30:38.817 --> 30:40.877
If you keep spoiling her like this,

30:40.897 --> 30:42.277
one day,

30:42.297 --> 30:44.177
she'll lose her life.

30:45.617 --> 30:46.897
Never curse

30:46.897 --> 30:48.657
my daughter.

30:54.057 --> 30:55.197
Mother.

30:55.217 --> 30:57.417
What exactly happened last night?

30:58.057 --> 30:59.717
Tell me everything.

30:59.737 --> 31:01.617
Don't miss anything.

31:02.617 --> 31:06.137
(Duke An's Mansion)

31:07.577 --> 31:09.217
Be gentle.

31:10.057 --> 31:12.737
Son, bear with it.

31:18.977 --> 31:20.077
Physician,

31:20.097 --> 31:21.377
how is

31:21.377 --> 31:22.497
my son's leg injury?

31:22.497 --> 31:23.357
Ma'am,

31:23.377 --> 31:25.837
his leg is severely injured.

31:25.857 --> 31:26.997
I'm afraid

31:27.017 --> 31:28.897
he won't be able to walk again.

31:29.257 --> 31:30.337
He's still so young.

31:30.337 --> 31:31.797
He can't be crippled.

31:31.817 --> 31:32.857
Whatever it costs,

31:32.857 --> 31:34.617
we must cure him.

31:35.017 --> 31:37.817
You should seek a better physician.

31:38.217 --> 31:39.857
- Physician...
- You...

31:39.857 --> 31:41.977
Please treat my leg.

31:41.977 --> 31:42.817
Mother.

31:42.817 --> 31:45.517
Physician, please think of something.

31:45.537 --> 31:46.557
Physician...

31:46.577 --> 31:49.557
- Mother, save my leg.
- Physician, save my son.

31:49.577 --> 31:50.937
Physician...

31:57.457 --> 31:58.597
Ji Chongyi,

31:58.617 --> 32:00.557
if you harm my baby,

32:00.577 --> 32:01.577
I will not let this go.

32:01.577 --> 32:03.277
I'm hurt,

32:03.297 --> 32:05.217
and you don't even look at me.

32:05.217 --> 32:07.557
How can you be so cruel?

32:07.577 --> 32:09.497
I'm cruel?

32:10.377 --> 32:11.737
Ji Chongyi,

32:12.017 --> 32:14.737
you're just a tool I used
to get into this family.

32:15.057 --> 32:17.177
Whether you're crippled or not,

32:17.657 --> 32:19.037
I couldn't care less.

32:19.057 --> 32:22.417
You venous woman.

32:23.737 --> 32:25.597
I told you

32:25.617 --> 32:28.657
Princess Mingyue was overbearing.

32:28.897 --> 32:31.577
Everyone in Ling'an was avoiding her,

32:31.617 --> 32:32.897
yet you still tried to get close.

32:32.897 --> 32:34.077
Look.

32:34.097 --> 32:35.617
Look at you now.

32:35.617 --> 32:37.277
What do you know as a businesswoman?

32:37.297 --> 32:38.577
I'm doing all this

32:38.577 --> 32:40.737
for the future of our family.

32:40.737 --> 32:43.897
The Grand Princess holds power now.

32:44.057 --> 32:45.797
Can I afford to offend her?

32:45.817 --> 32:48.737
The court is full of intrigue.

32:49.257 --> 32:51.117
Even your father can't handle it.

32:51.137 --> 32:52.297
Who do you think you are

32:52.297 --> 32:53.697
to get involved?

32:54.057 --> 32:55.617
You're just seeking death.

32:56.857 --> 32:57.737
If not for worrying

32:57.737 --> 32:59.337
about my baby,

32:59.617 --> 33:01.737
I wouldn't even bother telling you this.

33:02.217 --> 33:03.357
My son.

33:03.377 --> 33:04.877
There's hope now.

33:04.897 --> 33:07.037
The Grand Princess sent a carriage
to pick you up.

33:07.057 --> 33:08.657
Her mansion has imperial physicians.

33:08.657 --> 33:10.317
They'll surely heal your leg.

33:10.337 --> 33:11.877
That's great, Mother.

33:11.897 --> 33:13.857
Let's go.

33:14.337 --> 33:15.377
Why are you standing there?

33:15.377 --> 33:16.817
Come here and help.

33:16.817 --> 33:18.217
He can't go.

33:18.297 --> 33:19.737
What did you say?

33:19.817 --> 33:21.897
You don't want my son to get better?

33:26.577 --> 33:28.517
- Mother.
- I've married him.

33:28.537 --> 33:30.737
We're all in the same boat.

33:31.137 --> 33:32.517
Think carefully.

33:32.537 --> 33:34.797
Two people died in the fire last night.

33:34.817 --> 33:36.937
One was the Censor-in-chief's son;

33:36.977 --> 33:38.757
the other was General Cui's nephew.

33:38.777 --> 33:40.317
The one who's missing is

33:40.337 --> 33:42.257
Rite Censor Sun's grandson.

33:42.297 --> 33:44.257
None of them are easy to deal with.

33:44.577 --> 33:45.617
Why is it only him

33:45.617 --> 33:47.497
and Princess Mingyue who survived?

33:47.537 --> 33:49.037
What do you mean by that?

33:49.057 --> 33:50.637
My son is also an heir.

33:50.657 --> 33:52.317
He's also a noble.

33:52.337 --> 33:54.337
Stop deceiving yourself.

33:54.497 --> 33:56.817
Our family is declining now.

33:56.897 --> 33:58.777
With this incident,

33:59.417 --> 34:01.777
they might even strip us of our title.

34:04.257 --> 34:07.137
The Censorate and the Rites Office

34:07.417 --> 34:09.377
aren't easy to deal with.

34:09.497 --> 34:10.937
They wouldn't let their kids

34:10.937 --> 34:12.617
die in vain.

34:12.897 --> 34:14.437
If someone has to take

34:14.457 --> 34:16.257
the blame for this,

34:16.377 --> 34:17.637
who do you think

34:17.657 --> 34:19.357
the Grand Princess will push forward

34:19.377 --> 34:21.057
to take the fall?

34:22.377 --> 34:24.657
Right, the Grand Princess

34:24.657 --> 34:26.577
probably isn't so kind.

34:28.857 --> 34:29.697
So, what do you think

34:29.697 --> 34:31.557
we should do now?

34:31.577 --> 34:32.937
In any case,

34:33.057 --> 34:35.337
he can't go
to the Grand Princess's Mansion.

34:37.177 --> 34:40.097
Please go and tell the Grand Princess

34:40.417 --> 34:42.137
that Chongyi can't move

34:42.377 --> 34:43.937
because of his leg.

34:44.497 --> 34:45.857
Good.

34:46.257 --> 34:48.297
I'll go and tell her.

34:50.977 --> 34:53.057
I didn't expect you

34:54.017 --> 34:56.137
to have some conscience.

34:56.377 --> 34:58.057
I'm not doing this for you

34:58.177 --> 35:00.177
but for my baby.

35:08.137 --> 35:09.137
What exactly caused

35:09.137 --> 35:10.977
the fire last night?

35:15.657 --> 35:18.377
For the sake of our family,

35:18.497 --> 35:20.457
you should tell me the truth.

35:25.217 --> 35:26.857
Actually, last night,

35:28.097 --> 35:29.937
besides the five of us,

35:33.097 --> 35:34.857
there was another man.

35:36.737 --> 35:38.577
They're searching for someone.

35:46.057 --> 35:48.017
They say many died.

35:51.857 --> 35:53.537
It's dangerous.

35:54.897 --> 35:56.177
How is it? Any findings?

35:56.177 --> 35:57.517
No.

35:57.537 --> 35:58.897
Long Dan,

35:58.937 --> 36:00.397
go search over there.

36:00.417 --> 36:02.177
- Yes. Follow me.
- Yes.

36:02.177 --> 36:04.757
Anyone who finds my grandson

36:04.777 --> 36:06.857
will be rewarded 1,000 taels.

36:06.857 --> 36:08.597
1,000 taels.

36:08.617 --> 36:09.737
It's 1,000 taels.

36:09.737 --> 36:11.097
Yes, let's go find him.

36:11.097 --> 36:12.057
Hurry up.

36:12.057 --> 36:13.617
Over there, over there.

36:13.617 --> 36:14.617
1,000 taels.

36:14.617 --> 36:15.917
- 1,000 taels.
- Mr. Sun.

36:15.937 --> 36:17.057
This is the Jinshui River,

36:17.057 --> 36:18.117
not a small creek.

36:18.137 --> 36:19.097
Even the best swimmer

36:19.097 --> 36:20.557
could have an accident.

36:21.577 --> 36:23.337
Please take back the reward.

36:23.337 --> 36:25.637
You can't find my grandson.

36:25.657 --> 36:28.057
Can't I search myself?

36:28.617 --> 36:30.197
The more people search,

36:30.217 --> 36:32.097
the greater the chance

36:32.097 --> 36:33.557
of finding my grandson.

36:33.577 --> 36:34.957
Over there.

36:34.977 --> 36:36.097
- Look over there.
- Hurry.

36:36.097 --> 36:37.577
Go look.

36:38.377 --> 36:39.837
Master, Miss.

36:39.857 --> 36:41.097
- How is it?
- Master, Miss.

36:41.097 --> 36:42.617
Nothing there either.

36:48.617 --> 36:50.837
No news is good news.

36:50.857 --> 36:52.317
It'll be fine.

36:52.337 --> 36:54.077
We'll definitely find your brother.

36:54.097 --> 36:55.757
He's a troublemaker.

36:55.777 --> 36:58.057
Troublemakers live long.

37:00.057 --> 37:01.437
Someone's underwater.

37:01.457 --> 37:02.657
My Lord, over here.

37:02.657 --> 37:04.017
We found him.

37:04.137 --> 37:05.697
We found him. Hurry.

37:08.017 --> 37:08.957
Let's go, let's go.

37:08.977 --> 37:10.817
Let's go, Master.

37:11.057 --> 37:12.177
Move, move.

37:12.177 --> 37:13.477
Over here, over here.

37:13.497 --> 37:15.097
Hurry. Over here.

37:15.097 --> 37:16.837
- Save him.
- Come and save him.

37:16.857 --> 37:18.217
Over there.

37:18.257 --> 37:19.617
Master.

37:19.777 --> 37:22.737
- Hurry and pull him up.
- Pull him up.

37:23.377 --> 37:24.747
Hurry.

37:24.977 --> 37:26.517
Get him up.

37:29.147 --> 37:30.077
Got him.

37:30.077 --> 37:31.137
It's really him.

37:31.137 --> 37:32.737
The purple robe...

37:34.057 --> 37:37.737
Sheng loved purple robes the most.

37:38.697 --> 37:40.177
Sheng...

37:40.377 --> 37:43.497
How can you do this?

37:43.897 --> 37:47.497
How can you let your grandpa bury you?

37:47.657 --> 37:48.937
- Chief.
- Miss.

37:48.937 --> 37:50.237
Si.

37:50.257 --> 37:52.337
- Miss.
- Send her back.

37:52.337 --> 37:53.697
Yes.

38:08.737 --> 38:10.097
Miss,

38:10.657 --> 38:12.737
you haven't eaten anything all day.

38:13.057 --> 38:15.177
At least drink some hot soup.

38:16.057 --> 38:17.417
Aman,

38:18.737 --> 38:20.617
any news about my brother?

38:32.057 --> 38:33.657
It's all my fault.

38:36.257 --> 38:38.137
It's my fault.

39:05.217 --> 39:06.577
Uncle,

39:07.057 --> 39:08.917
why not go back and rest?

39:08.937 --> 39:10.377
I'll stay here.

39:11.057 --> 39:13.137
Why is the Jinshui River

39:14.577 --> 39:16.297
so deep

39:17.857 --> 39:19.577
and so long?

39:20.737 --> 39:23.237
You can't overexert yourself.

39:23.257 --> 39:25.497
How can you keep searching if you do?

39:31.577 --> 39:33.577
If we find him,

39:35.577 --> 39:37.497
will he still be alive?

39:39.017 --> 39:40.377
Sure.

39:41.477 --> 39:43.037
He'll certainly be alive.

39:51.657 --> 39:53.017
I...

39:54.977 --> 39:57.457
I'm not worthy to be a father.

39:59.417 --> 40:01.017
Since he was young,

40:01.777 --> 40:04.377
I've never disciplined him.

40:05.017 --> 40:07.097
When he grew up,

40:08.257 --> 40:10.297
all I did was scold him

40:12.337 --> 40:14.177
and complain.

40:15.257 --> 40:17.977
I never truly cared about him.

40:19.977 --> 40:22.177
Though he was mischievous,

40:23.377 --> 40:25.697
he was a good kid.

40:30.657 --> 40:34.937
I failed him.

40:43.777 --> 40:45.217
Uncle, don't worry.

40:45.777 --> 40:47.657
I will definitely find him.

40:52.057 --> 40:53.697
We'll definitely find him.

40:53.697 --> 40:55.057
Yes.

40:57.577 --> 41:01.177
We'll definitely find him.

41:07.617 --> 41:09.057
Your Highness,

41:09.137 --> 41:11.017
you must help me.

41:11.017 --> 41:12.377
Your Highness,

41:12.577 --> 41:14.117
my son was burned.

41:14.137 --> 41:16.117
His face is unrecognizable.

41:16.137 --> 41:19.817
This is horrible, Your Highness.

41:21.577 --> 41:23.377
Mr. Zhang, sorry for your loss.

41:23.737 --> 41:25.737
But I don't understand

41:26.057 --> 41:27.977
why your son

41:28.137 --> 41:29.097
was

41:29.097 --> 41:30.977
with Princess Mingyue.

41:32.577 --> 41:34.577
Your Highness, please trust me.

41:35.537 --> 41:38.297
You're the reason why I'm here today.

41:38.377 --> 41:39.917
And I am

41:39.937 --> 41:42.297
loyal to you.

41:43.137 --> 41:44.477
Zhang Sheng

41:44.497 --> 41:46.557
was only my concubine's son.

41:46.577 --> 41:48.477
He was uneducated

41:48.497 --> 41:49.917
and unambitious,

41:49.937 --> 41:53.017
failing in the imperial exams
time and again.

41:53.777 --> 41:56.617
I also neglected to discipline him.

41:56.777 --> 41:59.337
I have no idea how this rascal

41:59.417 --> 42:00.737
got involved

42:00.737 --> 42:02.937
with Princess Mingyue.

42:08.217 --> 42:10.057
Though his mother was a concubine,

42:10.337 --> 42:12.817
he was still your son.

42:14.417 --> 42:15.457
It's too bad

42:15.457 --> 42:17.037
that he was burned to death

42:17.457 --> 42:19.657
somehow like this.

42:20.577 --> 42:21.937
Your Highness,

42:22.257 --> 42:24.937
it's the Grand Princess's fault
for bad parenting.

42:25.057 --> 42:27.197
Princess Mingyue is undisciplined,

42:27.217 --> 42:29.837
indulging in pleasures
and losing herself,

42:29.857 --> 42:31.637
which has led to the accident

42:31.657 --> 42:34.337
and killed several men.

42:34.697 --> 42:36.037
Your Highness,

42:36.057 --> 42:38.517
I'll report it to His Majesty

42:38.537 --> 42:41.057
and demand Princess Mingyue be punished.

42:49.857 --> 42:54.097
(The End of Episode 13)

42:54.587 --> 42:56.317
♪ From place to place ♪

42:56.317 --> 43:01.257
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:01.627 --> 43:04.007
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:04.007 --> 43:08.237
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:08.947 --> 43:11.347
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:11.367 --> 43:15.027
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:15.047 --> 43:18.467
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:18.617 --> 43:24.137
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:24.957 --> 43:28.637
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:28.637 --> 43:32.717
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:32.957 --> 43:34.697
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:34.717 --> 43:39.417
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:39.417 --> 43:42.987
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:43.007 --> 43:47.237
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:47.257 --> 43:49.037
♪ Time glows ♪

43:49.037 --> 43:53.577
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:53.597 --> 43:58.397
♪ And stars ♪

44:02.627 --> 44:05.157
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:05.177 --> 44:08.797
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.817 --> 44:12.247
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:12.267 --> 44:16.887
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.887 --> 44:20.577
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:20.597 --> 44:24.687
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.797 --> 44:26.617
♪ Time glows ♪

44:26.617 --> 44:31.167
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:31.187 --> 44:34.887
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:34.907 --> 44:39.067
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:39.247 --> 44:41.007
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:41.007 --> 44:45.527
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:45.527 --> 44:49.167
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:49.187 --> 44:54.857
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:56.547 --> 44:58.477
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:58.477 --> 45:05.977
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
